File name: PLRMLOOP.MP
Path description: Saracen Fortress, raider area only.
Path starts: Plaster Hallway
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Module 6
Level recommendation: 40 if you have room attack spells, 45+ otherwise.
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: saracen raider, saracen commander, saracen leader.
Additional information:

This loop includes the saracen commander. Being able to cast room spells
helps. To get to the start of this loop you need a copper amulet.

Before using this loop, you _MUST_ setup a message (in Game Data -> Messages
as follows:

Name: Pull winch failed.
Begins with: You heave mightily on the winch, but it does not budge.
Ends with:
Responce: pull winch^M
Check-boxes: Last action failed, Ignore, Find anywhere in text.

Included in the zip are SHEHPLRM.MP and PLRMSHEH.MP which are paths
to and from the start of this loop.
